// The data modelling example: the types of a domain as a class diagram and
// its tables as an entity relationship diagram, both drawn over all their
// records, written out as Mermaid and as an OpenAPI description, with
// versions kept when the modeller says so. Its modules are in the
// modelling folder next to this file.
project Modelling
    title "Data Modelling"
    stack csharp avalonia desktop
    output "out"
    language "en"
    datasource main sqlite "data/modelling.db"
    filestore exports "setting:exportsFolder"
    filestore code "setting:codeFolder"
